# Template — copy this file to `.env.local` and put your real token there.
# `.env.local` is gitignored; this file is not, so never write a real token below.
#
# Mint a token at: Figma → Settings → Security → Personal access tokens
# Minimum scope: file content — read. Nothing in this kit writes to Figma.
#
# The env var and the file the scripts read are both configurable, via `auth.envVar` and
# `auth.envFile` in figma.config.json. An exported environment variable always wins over the file,
# which is how CI supplies the token (as a secret) without a file on disk.

FIGMA_ACCESS_TOKEN=figd_your_personal_access_token_here
